    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> with a Recognition System can identify its owner and won't function for anyone else. Fooling a Recognition System takes 1 minute and a DC 30 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check. The owner of gear with this Upgrade can deactivate it as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> (before passing a Weapon to an unarmed ally, for example); optionally, the Recognition System can have a code phrase that allows anyone to activate it. </p>",
